          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>Taking care of your eyes shouldn’t feel complicated. Whether you’re coming in for a routine eye exam or something just doesn’t feel quite right, we’re here to help. Academy Vision provides thorough eye exams for patients of all ages, so you and your family can feel confident about your vision.</p>",
