      "nodes": [
        {
          "t": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Why Regular Eye Exams Are So Important",
          "html": "Why Regular Eye Exams Are So Important",
          "align": "center",
          "id": "xbwiSvawn4",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>A lot can change with your eyes over time, and not all of it is easy to notice on your own. An eye exam isn’t just about seeing clearly; it’s also about making sure your eyes are healthy. We check for early signs of eye conditions like glaucoma, macular degeneration, and other issues that can develop without obvious symptoms. Catching these changes early makes a big difference, and regular eye exams help you stay one step ahead.</p>",
          "align": "center",
          "id": "R83zPNyTqE",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
