      "nodes": [
        {
          "t": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "A More Thorough, More Personal Exam Experience",
          "html": "A More Thorough, More Personal Exam Experience",
          "id": "J7AJJRThsP",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>When you come into our Pine Beach eye clinic, you won’t feel rushed or pushed through your appointment. Our eye doctors take the time to understand what you’re experiencing, answer your questions, and walk you through everything we’re seeing.</p><p>Using modern technology and years of hands-on experience, we make sure nothing gets overlooked. You’ll leave with clear answers and a plan that makes sense for your day-to-day life.</p>",
          "id": "QjzzSwPPKR",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
