          "t": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "What Your Eye Exam Includes at Academy Vision",
          "html": "What Your Eye Exam Includes at Academy Vision",
          "id": "Sticps9VBt",
          "col": 1,
          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>Your exam is designed to give you a complete picture of your vision and eye health. Our optometrists will:</p><ul><li>Check your prescription to make sure you’re seeing clearly</li><li>Evaluate how your eyes are working together</li><li>Take a close look at your eye health, including any signs of concerns</li><li>Talk through anything we find in plain language that you can understand</li></ul>",
          "id": "8RhuPSWHHo",
          "col": 1,
          "origin": "static"
        },
