      "nodes": [
        {
          "t": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Eye Exams for Kids, Adults, and Seniors",
          "html": "Eye Exams for Kids, Adults, and Seniors",
          "id": "le3nBevMF7",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>No two stages of life look the same, and your eye care shouldn’t either. We see patients of all ages, from young kids coming in for their first exam to adults staying on top of changes in their vision.</p><p>If it’s easier to schedule everyone together, we can do that too. It’s one of the ways we help make eye care simpler for your whole family.</p>",
          "id": "lqpFUYx2n5",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
