        {
          "t": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Signs You Should Schedule an Eye Exam",
          "html": "Signs You Should Schedule an Eye Exam",
          "id": "q2UJzAr2mt",
          "col": 1,
          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>Sometimes it’s obvious, but other times, small changes can be easy to ignore. If you’ve noticed any of the following, it’s a good idea to come in:</p><ul><li>Your vision feels blurry or isn’t as sharp as it used to be</li><li>You’re dealing with headaches or eye strain</li><li>Driving at night feels more difficult than before</li><li>Your eyes feel dry, irritated, or tired throughout the day</li><li>It’s been a while since your last eye exam</li></ul>",
          "id": "W8H7NQ2ATR",
          "col": 1,
          "origin": "static"
        },
